{"availability":"available","full":"AdrianAdem/athlete-dashboard","name":"athlete-dashboard","description":"Personal training, nutrition and recovery app. React + TypeScript, Strava and Garmin integrations, with a backend-free local demo.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-14T09:38:26Z","updated":"2026-09-21T17:32:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://adrianadem.github.io/athlete-dashboard/","topics":["garmin","health-tracking","react","strava","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://adrianadem.github.io/athlete-dashboard/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.227Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.227Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.227Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.227Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":[],"features":["Strength training — training plans, per-set logging (weight × reps), rest timer, exercise history","Training analytics — estimated 1RM via the Brzycki formula, volume and max-weight trends per exercise, a 12-week training heatmap, and scored progress/consistency/intensity/volume metrics","Routines — recurring routines with weekday scheduling and date ranges, per-step completion tracking, swipe-to-delete","Cardio — Strava OAuth import plus manual entry, GPS live tracking on a Leaflet map with screen wake lock, and per-activity stream charts for pace, heart rate, and elevation","Nutrition — barcode scanning, FatSecret database search, LLM-parsed freetext entry, macro and micronutrient tracking against RDA targets, water logging"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AdrianAdem/athlete-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"93afd581943f142019d2d522034dbcb649f45efd28556a1b18074f6c2fff9494","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.395Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.395Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":null,"audience":[],"r